"Acme in webroot mode. The web server must be accessible from the internet on "
"port 80."
msgstr ""
"Web伺服器根目錄；設定Web伺服器文件的根目錄以在「Webroot 模式」下執行ACME。Web"
"伺服器的80埠必須允許從Internet存取。"

